{
  "key": 57386,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: Glad to meet you. I’m Monica\n",
        "of Monday.\r",
        "As a token of our friendship, I have a\n",
        "gift for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: It’s an item that raises the\n",
        "power of Flying-type moves.\r",
        "You should equip a bird Pokémon with\n",
        "that item."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: My brothers and sisters are all\n",
        "over the place.\r",
        "See if you could find them all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: Oh no! Today isn’t Monday.\n",
        "See you another time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Tuscany: Please allow me to introduce\n",
        "myself. I am Tuscany of Tuesday.\r",
        "By way of introduction, please accept\n",
        "this gift, a TwistedSpoon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Tuscany: Wouldn’t you agree that it is\n",
        "most adorable?\r",
        "It strengthens Psychic-type moves.\r",
        "I am certain it will be of use."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Tuscany: Have you met Monica, my older\n",
        "sister?\r",
        "Or my younger brother, Wesley?\r",
        "I am the second of seven children."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Tuscany: Tuesday was over before I\n",
        "even noticed...\r",
        "I’ll see you again next Tuesday..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Wesley: I’m Wesley of Wednesday.\r",
        "Pleased to meet you. Please take a\n",
        "souvenir.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Wesley: Black Belt beefs up the power\n",
        "of Fighting-type moves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Wesley: Since you found me, you must\n",
        "have met my brothers and sisters.\r",
        "Or did you just get lucky?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Wesley: No way!\n",
        "Wednesday’s already over!\f",
        "See you next week!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Arthur: Who are you?\r",
        "I’m Arthur of Thursday.\r",
        "Here, take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Arthur: If you use Rock-type moves,\n",
        "you should give that to your Pokémon.\r",
        "It raises the strength of\n",
        "Rock-type moves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Arthur: I’m Arthur of Thursday!\n",
        "I’m the second son in a line of seven\f",
        "siblings!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Arthur: Do you think that the middle of\n",
        "the week is Wednesday?\f",
        "Or do you think it’s Thursday?\r",
        "Go decide, and I’ll see you\n",
        "next Thursday!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Frieda: Yahoo! It’s Friday!\r",
        "I’m Frieda of Friday!\n",
        "Nice to meet you!\r",
        "Here’s a Poison Barb for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Frieda: Give it to a Pokémon that has\n",
        "Poison-type moves.\r",
        "Oh! It’s wicked!\r",
        "You’ll be shocked how good it makes\n",
        "Poison-type moves!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Frieda: Hiya! What day do you like?\r",
        "I love Friday. No doubt about it!\r",
        "Don’t you think it’s great too?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Frieda: Oh, today’s not Friday?\r",
        "Man... I wish every day were Friday,\n",
        "that’d be so much fun!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Santos: ...It’s Saturday...\r",
        "I’m Santos of Saturday...\r",
        "Take this...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Santos: ...\r",
        "Soft Sand...\r",
        "Ground-type moves get stronger...\n",
        "It will startle you..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Santos: ...\r",
        "See you again on another Saturday..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Santos: Today’s Saturday...\n",
        "No... Wait... Huh?\r",
        "I’ll see you next Saturday then..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Sunny: Hi! I’m Sunny of Sunday, meaning\n",
        "it’s Sunday today!\r",
        "I was told to give you this if I saw you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Sunny: That thing...\r",
        "Um...\r",
        "...What was it now...\r",
        "...\r",
        "Oh! I remember now!\r",
        "A Pokémon that knows Electric-type\n",
        "moves should hold it.\r",
        "My sis Monica said it powers up\n",
        "Electric-type moves!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Sunny: My sister Monica...\n",
        "My sister Tuscany...\f",
        "My brother Wesley...\f",
        "My brother Arthur...\f",
        "My sister Frieda...\f",
        "And my brother Santos.\r",
        "They’re all older than me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Sunny: Huh? Isn’t today Sunday?\n",
        "Um... I forgot!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: Hey, you!\n",
        "The one who found all of my siblings!\f",
        "Yeah, you!\r",
        "We’re pretty good friends now, don’t\n",
        "you agree?\r",
        "Since we’re such good friends, I’ll give\n",
        "you this Alert Ribbon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Monica: That Alert Ribbon looks great\n",
        "on your Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00030",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} put on the Alert Ribbon!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0752_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "You can only get one ribbon per week...\r",
        "If you want another ribbon, come find\n",
        "me again next week!"
